    "notes": "E10. Six actual source stages per direction: crooked left shield, loss of support, right hand seeks mask, knees ground, side fall, final collapse in a small local mud trace. Anatomical left shield/right wrist blades stay on their limbs. QA independent review approved the replacement A pages and complete final left B7. Right A reaches two knees earlier than left, allowed by the exact source. No offensive projectile/plasma, death entity, opponent or campaign state is added. Ground anchors manually reviewed on support feet/knees and collapsed ground-contact baseline. Fixed body references A-right645/A-left624/B336, never per-pose flattened height. Calibrations are excluded; playback durations are for visual inspection, not source mechanics."
